---
kind: lore
id: south.moonstone
title: Moonstone Cave — the cave, its trainers, and the dig's ramp crew
---

// Repeat visits (the first is south.moonstoneCave, the dig south.moonstoneDig).
<entry id="southMoonstoneDigLights" on="enterPlace" target="place.moonstoneCave" category="bark" priority="-5" once="day" when="run.lair.quarryDig == 'found'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The work lights are still burning below. The three ramps are the only ways down.
</entry>

<entry id="southMoonstoneQuiet" on="enterPlace" target="place.moonstoneCave" category="bark" priority="-5" once="day" when="run.lair.quarryDig == 'cleared'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The dig is dark now. The Duskbats have moved back into the pit, and the miners have moved back into the upper tunnels, and both seem happier for it.
</entry>

// ── Cave trainers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneHikerBrom" who="moonstoneHikerBrom" intro="WHOA! Don't sneak up on a man in a cave! Now I'm rattled. Rattled men battle!" win="I'm still rattled. Different reasons." lose="Nothing like a cave battle to settle the nerves!" prize="320" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="southMoonstoneHikerBromAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneHikerBrom" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneHikerBrom'])">
  @moonstoneHikerBrom{code="0010"}: Lunafae live deep down, where the moonstones are. You'll hear them before you see them. They sound like wind chimes somebody is sad about.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneSuperNerdPell" who="moonstoneSuperNerdPell" intro="I came for the fossils and there are PEOPLE IN BLACK taking all the fossils. I am upset. I will battle you about it." win="I feel slightly less upset." lose="That helped a lot, actually." prize="336" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="southMoonstoneSuperNerdPellAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneSuperNerdPell" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneSuperNerdPell'])">
  <match subject="run.lair.quarryDig">
    <when is="cleared">
      @moonstoneSuperNerdPell{code="0010"}: You chased them out! If you took a fossil, take it to Dr. Kell at the Pebbleton museum. She can bring them back. Back to LIFE.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @moonstoneSuperNerdPell{code="0020"}: Dome fossils, spiral fossils, and they're loading them into crates like potatoes. Somebody should stop them. Not me. Somebody.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneLassTilly" who="moonstoneLassTilly" intro="I'm looking for a moonstone for my Lunafae. Have you got one? No? Then you've got a battle." win="No moonstone and no win. Great day." lose="Still no moonstone. At least I won." prize="160" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="southMoonstoneLassTillyAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneLassTilly" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneLassTilly'])">
  @moonstoneLassTilly{code="0010"}: The Lunafae crowd round the old moonstone seam at night. I'd wait, but my mum said home by dark, and it's always dark in here.
</entry>

// ── Team Eclipse: the ramp crew (the Digmaster is south.moonstoneDig) ───

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneGruntSable" when="run.lair.quarryDig == 'found'" who="moonstoneGruntSable" intro="You don't look like a miner. You look like trouble." win="Okay, you're trouble. Confirmed." lose="Out. Now." prize="400" instance="use-004">
  @moonstoneGruntSable{code="0010"}: Hey! This ramp is closed! By order of Eclipse! Which is me!
</beat>

<entry id="southMoonstoneGruntSableAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneGruntSable" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneGruntSable'])">
  @moonstoneGruntSable{code="0010"}: The Director doesn't care about fossils. He cares about what's under the fossils. Don't tell anyone I said that. Don't tell anyone I said anything.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneGruntFlint" when="run.lair.quarryDig == 'found'" who="moonstoneGruntFlint" intro="Let's make sure you get hurt a little, then. Only the small form." win="I'm the one who needs the form now." lose="Paperwork avoided." prize="400" instance="use-005">
  @moonstoneGruntFlint{code="0010"}: A kid! In the dig! Do you know how many forms I have to fill in if you get hurt?
</beat>

<entry id="southMoonstoneGruntFlintAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneGruntFlint" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneGruntFlint'])">
  @moonstoneGruntFlint{code="0010"}: I joined Eclipse for the dental plan. There is no dental plan.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="moonstoneGruntMarl" when="run.lair.quarryDig == 'found'" who="moonstoneGruntMarl" intro="I am a wall. A wall in a uniform." win="Walls fall down, I guess." lose="Wall stands!" prize="440" instance="use-006">
  @moonstoneGruntMarl{code="0010"}: The Digmaster said nobody gets past the third ramp. I'm the third ramp.
</beat>

<entry id="southMoonstoneGruntMarlAfter" on="talk" target="npc.moonstoneGruntMarl" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['moonstoneGruntMarl'])">
  @moonstoneGruntMarl{code="0010"}: Go on down, then. The Digmaster's in the pit. She's worse than me. Much worse. Good luck.
</entry>
